We begin by drawing a diagram: [asy]
pair A,B,C,D,E,X;
A=(0,9); B=(0,0); C=(13,0); E=(A+C)/2; D=(A+B)/2; X = intersectionpoint(B--E,D--C); label("$X$",X,N);
